MoBetta: mtld3d: Turn HDR and the shader cache off in the wow profile.

athei/mtld3d v0.15.1 (9919759) defaults to color.hdr.enable=true, an
RGBA16Float wantsEDR layer. While its EDR headroom ramps, Wine's explorer
refreshes its display devices every ~250 ms for ~45 s and WoW's first frame
waits behind it: a black title screen, and a maximize stalls the same way
(MoBetta Session #12, DECISIONS.md #8). shaderCache.enable=true writes
mtld3d_shaders.bin next to Wow.exe, inside the game folder (MoBetta
constraint 1).

Both go into the built-in wow profile instead of a per-prefix MTLD3D_CONFIG,
so a packaged engine carries them into any wrapper. The profile is the
weakest layer: mtld3d.conf and MTLD3D_CONFIG still override either key.

diff --git a/windows/core/src/app_profile.rs b/windows/core/src/app_profile.rs
index df39443..6e29cd7 100644
--- a/windows/core/src/app_profile.rs
+++ b/windows/core/src/app_profile.rs
@@ -86,13 +86,20 @@ static PROFILES: &[AppProfile] = &[
     // opening Video Options with more sizes than that fails with a Lua error.
     // Wine's emulated mode list runs to forty-odd sizes, so the profile offers
     // at most 32; the refresh rates of each kept size do not add buttons.
+    //
+    // MoBetta: HDR is off. The clients have no HDR content, and the EDR
+    // layer's headroom ramp keeps Wine's explorer refreshing its display
+    // devices for ~45 s, during which the game's first frame waits (black
+    // title screen) and a maximize stalls. The shader cache is off because
+    // it writes next to the executable, inside the game folder.
     AppProfile {
         name: "wow",
         exe: "WoW.exe",
         company: Some("Blizzard Entertainment"),
         product: Some("World of Warcraft"),
         original_filename: None,
-        settings: "query.flushImmediate=true;query.eventImmediate=true;display.maxResolutions=32",
+        settings: "query.flushImmediate=true;query.eventImmediate=true;display.maxResolutions=32;\
+                   color.hdr.enable=false;shaderCache.enable=false",
     },
 ];
 
diff --git a/windows/core/src/app_profile/tests.rs b/windows/core/src/app_profile/tests.rs
index 10c44fa..13014ac 100644
--- a/windows/core/src/app_profile/tests.rs
